        "en": "Groundbreaking archaeological excavations and archival analyses documented by BBC History re-examined the origin of ancient olympic games.",
        "ko": "BBC History가 기록한 획기적인 고고학 발굴과 문헌 분석은 The Origin of Ancient Olympic Games을(를) 재조명했습니다.",
