        "ko": "American Psychological Association의 임상 심리학자들은 Prospect Theory and the Asymmetry of Loss Aversion을(를) 이해하는 것이 개인이 효과적인 초인지 전략을 숙달하도록 돕는다고 강조합니다.",
        "chunks": "Clinical psychologists at American Psychological Association emphasize / that understanding prospect theory and the asymmetry of loss aversion / empowers people / to master effective metacognitive strategies.",
        "paragraph": 2
