        "ko": "American Economic Review에 발표된 실증 계량경제학 연구는 The Microeconomics of Two-Sided Platform Markets을(를) 지배하는 구조적 역학을 분석했습니다.",
        "chunks": "Empirical econometric investigations / published in American Economic Review / analyzed the structural dynamics / governing the microeconomics of two-sided platform markets.",
